1316:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_usart.h ****   * @note   Call of this function is equivalent to following function call sequence :
1317:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_usart.h ****   *         - Data Width configuration using @ref LL_USART_SetDataWidth() function
1318:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_usart.h ****   *         - Parity Control and mode configuration using @ref LL_USART_SetParity() function
1319:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_usart.h ****   *         - Stop bits configuration using @ref LL_USART_SetStopBitsLength() function
