1478:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_usart.h ****   * @rmtoll CR2          MSBFIRST      LL_USART_GetTransferBitOrder
1479:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_usart.h ****   * @param  USARTx USART Instance
